description: Super Harness entrypoint - team-shared durable memory for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository uses **super-harness** to keep team knowledge in the repo
instead of each contributor's individual chat history.

Before doing any meaningful work, read:

- `harness/standards/agent-harness-rules.md` — collaboration rules
- `harness/plans/progress.md` — latest checkpoint / handoff index
- `harness/plans/feature-list.json` — current backlog with passing status

Long-term rules live in `harness/standards/`. Architecture decisions live
in `harness/architecture/adr/`. Verification evidence lives in
`harness/verification/`.

**Single source of truth: this file is navigation only.** Do not duplicate
rules or decisions here — update the corresponding file under `harness/`.
